No common primary clock between related clocks  
The clocks clk_a and clk_b are related (timed together) but they have no common primary clock. The design could fail in hardware. To find a timing path between these clocks, run the following command: report_timing -from [get_clocks clk_a] -to [get_clocks clk_b]
